<doc id="49100" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=49100" title="Isa">
Isa

Isa (&lt;a href="basa%20Arab"&gt;basa Arab&lt;/a&gt;:عيسى, `Īsā) (watara 1 - 32M) diangkat dadi &lt;a href="Nabi%20Islam"&gt;nabi&lt;/a&gt; kanggo nyiarake/nyebarake agama marang kaum &lt;a href="Bani%20Israil"&gt;Bani Israil&lt;/a&gt;. Inti ajaran kang digawa dening Nabi Isa padha karo ajaran &lt;a href="Islam"&gt;Islam&lt;/a&gt; saiki yaiku mung nyembah 1 gusti, yaiku &lt;a href="Allah"&gt;Allah&lt;/a&gt;. Kitab kang mudhun kanggo panjenengane yaiku &lt;a href="Injil"&gt;Injil&lt;/a&gt;. Nabi Isa as nduweni shahabat/murid cerak kang misuwur kanthi jeneng &lt;a href="Al-Hawariyyun"&gt;Al-Hawariyyun&lt;/a&gt; kang cacahe 12 wong. Nabi Isa as dioyak-oyak dening prajurit keratone &lt;a href="Herodes"&gt;Herodes&lt;/a&gt; kang banget kejem. Pungkasane Nabi Isa as bisa kapikut amarga pitulungane &lt;a href="Yudas%20Iskariot"&gt;Yahuda&lt;/a&gt;, shahabate Nabi Isa as kang malik tingal saka panjenengane. Amarga pitulungane Allah mula Nabi Isa as dislametake lan diangkat menyang &lt;a href="langit"&gt;langit&lt;/a&gt; ing umur 33 taun.
Babagan kerasulan Nabi Isa as, iki dingendikakake dening Allah Swt:
"Al-Masih putrane &lt;a href="Maryam"&gt;Maryam&lt;/a&gt; iku mung &lt;a href="Rasul"&gt;Rasul&lt;/a&gt;. Sadurunge uga wis kliwat sawetara rasul. Lan ibune iku wong kang gocekan raket marang bebener..." (&lt;a href="Surat%20Al%20Maa-idah"&gt;QS Al-Maidah&lt;/a&gt;:75)
<h2>Sejarahe</h2>
Sejarahe.
Sadurungé Allah nyiptakaké Isa, Allah ngutus malaékat &lt;a href="Jibril"&gt;Jibril&lt;/a&gt; awujud manungsa marang &lt;a href="Maryam"&gt;Maryam&lt;/a&gt;. Ing wektu iku &lt;a href="Maryam"&gt;Maryam&lt;/a&gt; ing pinggir etan omahé dhewéan.
Pas weruh ana Malaékat &lt;a href="Jibril"&gt;Jibril&lt;/a&gt; Maryam langsung nyuwun tulung dhateng Allah supaya malaékat &lt;a href="Jibril"&gt;Jibril&lt;/a&gt; ngedohb saka dhèwèké. Banjur malaékat &lt;a href="Jibril"&gt;Jibril&lt;/a&gt; wangsuli, yèn dhèwèké iku utusaning Allah marang Maryam supaya bisa duwé putra lanang sing mengko dadi &lt;a href="Nabi"&gt;Nabi&lt;/a&gt;.
