Paskah (&lt;a href="Basa%20Grikenlan"&gt;Grikenlan&lt;/a&gt;: Πάσχα utawa Paskha) iku riyaya paling wigati sajeroning &lt;a href="taun%20liturgi"&gt;taun liturgi&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="gr%C3%A9ja"&gt;gréja&lt;/a&gt;wi &lt;a href="Kristen"&gt;Kristen&lt;/a&gt;. Tumrap umat &lt;a href="Kristen"&gt;Kristen&lt;/a&gt;, Paskah identik karo &lt;a href="Yesus"&gt;Yesus&lt;/a&gt;, kang déning &lt;a href="Paulus%20saka%20Tarsus"&gt;Paulus&lt;/a&gt; sinebut "cempé Paskah"; jemaat Kristen nganti saiki percaya yèn &lt;a href="Yesus"&gt;Yesus&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="panyaliban%20Gusti%20Yesus"&gt;disalibaké&lt;/a&gt;, séda lan dikubur&lt;a href="%23endnote_Anone"&gt;[a&lt;/a&gt;], lan &lt;a href="Pengakuan%20Iman%20Rasuli"&gt;ing dina katelu&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href="%23endnote_Bnone"&gt;[b&lt;/a&gt;] &lt;a href="Gusti%20Yesus%20wungu%20saka%20s%C3%A9da"&gt;wungu saka antarané wong mati&lt;/a&gt;. Paskah ngrayakaké dina wungu Dalem mau lan minangka riyaya kang paling wigati amarga mèngeti prastawa kang paling sakral sajeroning uripé Yesus.
